hieve expected market acceptance, we may not be successful in commercializing such products.","section":"RISK FACTORS SUMMARY","block":64,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001434647-26-000011","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-09","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001434647","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1434647/000143464726000011/zvra-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/d30172d1bea9ba87ecf300a6ff41486662a161f22dd625c267dbf92cedacb8dc.bin","sha256":"d30172d1bea9ba87ecf300a6ff41486662a161f22dd625c267dbf92cedacb8dc"}},{"id":"ec07a2145bf9be8a145a3e0235d7b7d2d57de5c396350f900f43f6f7406cfd2e","quote":"•We may be subject to enforcement action if we engage in improper marketing or promotion of our products.","context":"•The target patient population for our rare disease products is small, so we must achieve significant market share and obtain relatively high per-patient prices to be successful.","section":"RISK FACTORS SUMMARY","block":65,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001434647-26-000011","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-09","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001434647","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1434647/000143464726000011/zvra-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/d30172d1bea9ba87ecf300a6ff41486662a161f22dd625c267dbf92cedacb8dc.bin","sha256":"d30172d1bea9ba87ecf300a6ff41486662a161f22dd625c267dbf92cedacb8dc"}},{"id":"3ac538c6a96b31302143ff5bb77a767dbeae53e244fd49bf4ba8a085937cec95","quote":"•Product liability claims could cause us to incur substantial liabilities and adversely affect commercialization of our products.","context":"•We may be subject to enforcement action if we engage in improper marketing or promotion of our products.","section":"RISK FACTORS SUMMARY","block":66,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_e